{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The world is dark and empty.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>A Dark Forest</i></strong> is an incremental idle horror game about discovering the unknown within and without yourself.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/EN5.gif?t=1749250161\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Everything the darkness touches is yours.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the world,</strong> gather resources and carve out a community of your own inside the dark forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Remember\u2026 the Darkness never sleeps, and it doesn't like new challengers.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/EN1.gif?t=1749250161\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Savior or tyrant?<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/ENEKSTRA.gif?t=1749250161\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ward off 11 abyssal entities.</strong> Will you spare or execute them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>There will be consequences\u2026 do you dare experience all endings?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/EN3.gif?t=1749250161\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">My good steward!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Control the faceless masses.</strong> Experience a strategic resource production chain mechanic and choose how you reign!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Will you implement absolute rule, allow for limited autonomy and freewill, or establish secretive freemasonry?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/ENprod.gif?t=1749250161\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dear diary\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience a twisting narrative.</strong> Will you shape the world, or be shaped by it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Will you ever stop, or is your greed immeasurable?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/EN4.gif?t=1749250161\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3314970?t=1749250161","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3314970?t=1749250161","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/fbfa10fbe7aa9967fabd51a0c39a15a45e34a691/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749250161","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/fbfa10fbe7aa9967fabd51a0c39a15a45e34a691/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749250161","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3687160,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo release!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are proud to publish the demo version for A Dark Forest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo is not synonymous with the 1.5 release, which is still in development.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The world is dark and empty.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>A Dark Forest</i></strong> is an incremental idle horror game about discovering the unknown within and without yourself.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314970/extras/EN5.gif?t=1749250161\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Everything the darkness touches is yours.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the world,</strong> gather resources and carve out a community of your own inside the dark forest.</p><p class=